<ContentPage title="Privacy Policy – Geo Football" heading="Privacy policy" description="How Geo Football handles your data: no accounts, progress kept in your browser, Google Analytics visit statistics and ads served by Adsterra, and how to opt out." path="/privacy/" ads={false}>
<p class="lede">Geo Football is a free football geography quiz with no accounts. This page explains, in plain language, what is stored on your device, what third-party services see when you visit, and how to opt out.</p>
<p><em>Last updated: {updated}.</em></p>

<h2>No accounts</h2>
<p>You never sign up, log in or give us your name or email address to play.</p>

<h2>What stays in your browser</h2>
<p>Your daily progress, streaks, stats, training-ground question history and settings (such as sound and <em>Confirm before locking in</em>) are saved in your browser’s local storage. They stay on your device, are never uploaded, and are removed when you clear this site’s data in your browser. Your answers and scores are never sent to us or to anyone else. If you arrive from a school platform, local storage also keeps an “ad-free until” date for 30 days, and your cookie choice (below) is kept under <code>cookieConsent</code>; neither holds anything else.</p>

<h2>Google Analytics</h2>
<p>We use Google Analytics (measurement ID G-QNZZDM7MD1) to count visits and see which pages are used. It sets cookies and collects page-visit statistics such as pages viewed, device and browser type, referring site and approximate location. It does not receive your answers, pins or scores. Google processes this data under the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a>; see also <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</p>

<h2>Advertising</h2>
<p>Ads on Geo Football are served by Adsterra. When an ad loads, Adsterra and its advertising partners receive standard technical information from your browser, such as your IP address, device and browser type and the page you are on, and may use cookies or similar identifiers to deliver ads, limit how often you see them and measure them. We use banner and native ad units only: no pop-ups, pop-unders or full-screen ads, and ads never cover the game. Ads are loaded only when you scroll near them. Students who arrive from Google Classroom, Canvas, or Schoology see no ads at all on that device for 30 days. Adsterra’s handling of this data is described in its <a href="https://adsterra.com/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>

<h2>Cookie choices</h2>
<p>Visitors in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland see a small cookie banner. Until you choose, Google Analytics runs without cookies and no ads load. <strong>Accept</strong> allows analytics and advertising cookies; <strong>Reject</strong> keeps analytics cookie-free and shows no ads. Your choice is stored in your browser for 180 days under <code>cookieConsent</code>, and you can change it at any time with <em>Cookie settings</em> in the footer.</p>

<h2>Sharing your score</h2>
<p>Nothing is shared unless you press a share button. A shared result contains your score, colour tiles, assists used and matchday number, plus a link to the game, never the answers. Posting to X or WhatsApp opens that service, whose own privacy policy then applies.</p>

<h2>How to opt out</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Cookies:</strong> block or delete cookies for this site and for third parties in your browser settings. The game still works without them.</li>
<li><strong>Ads:</strong> an ad blocker or your browser’s tracking protection stops the ad scripts from loading.</li>
<li><strong>Analytics:</strong> install Google’s <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</li>
<li><strong>Your game data:</strong> clear this site’s data in your browser to delete your progress, stats and history.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>If the way Geo Football handles data changes, we will update this page and the date at the top.</p>
</ContentPage>
